<title>GERMANY: SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 ATLETICO MADRID 0 LATEST.</title>
<headline>SOCCER-BORUSSIA DORTMUND 1 ATLETICO MADRID 0 LATEST.</headline>
<dateline>DORTMUND, Germany 1996-10-30</dateline>
<text>
